<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<gpx version="1.1" creator="Good Shit" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><trk><name>Bakkanosi from Jordalen — Jordalen–Slettedalen–Bakkanosi summit return [planning only — not navigation-grade]</name><desc>From Jordalen’s community house, follow the established road and Slettedalen walking path past summer farms, then continue through Lyngsskaret to Bakkanosi’s main summit ground. Return along the same path, roughly 16.8 km in total. Choose suitable snow-free July–September conditions. The mountain path is unmarked and can be indistinct: carry a map and compass, avoid fog and cornices, and stay well back from the fjord rim. Use signed paid parking, carry water, respect farms and wildlife, keep dogs leashed and obey closures.

Route geometry: © OpenStreetMap contributors; identifiable GPS trace Bakkanosi_Trail.gpx by Nik-O-Dim — https://www.openstreetmap.org/user/Nik-O-Dim/traces/2275880. ODbL 1.0 — https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/. Changes: selected the complete original normal trail to the main Bakkanosi summit ground, added the existing Jordalen road approach through an exact source-segment intersection, and retraced the full walking course. Original339-point provider collection is retained; source continuation beyond the original main-summit purpose is excluded. No synthetic connector, private operator/author GPX geometry or elevation profile. Planning only; not navigation-grade.

Route geometry: © OpenStreetMap contributors; identifiable GPS trace by Nik-O-Dim — Bakkanosi record-scoped identifiable GPS trace and original Jordalen OSM walking geometry. Licence: ODbL-1.0 (https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/). Source: https://api.openstreetmap.org/api/0.6/trackpoints?bbox=6.71393,60.87627,6.85597,60.92154&amp;page=0. Dataset: https://www.openstreetmap.org/user/Nik-O-Dim/traces/2275880.

